      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the timeline for the Q3 rollout. We need to get the legacy DB hooked up to that new cloud API we just provisioned. To keep us on track and avoid any massive budget hikes for middleware, can we just go ahead with a direct integration? Is it straightforward enough to just plug them in, or is there a major compatibility issue we need to worry about before I sign off on this?",
